## Wait for transaction receipt​
Use the public client to wait for the transaction receipt, which confirms that the transaction has been mined.


```
useEffect(() => {  
 (async () => {  
 if (hash) {  
 const receipt = await publicClient.waitForTransactionReceipt({ hash });  
 setReceipt(receipt);  
